 353+ 6CD0              RestoreBackgroundCell:
 354+ 6CD0 FD E5            push iy                ; Preserva IY
 355+ 6CD2 C5               push bc
 356+ 6CD3 D5               push de
 357+ 6CD4 E5               push hl
